by Chris Wallace.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.516
-We know that roughly,

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:21.620
nearly 4,000 known
or suspected terrorists

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.856
come into our country illegally.

00:10:23.856 --> 00:10:25.891
And we know that our most
vulnerable point of entry...

00:10:25.891 --> 00:10:27.125
-Wait, wait, wait.
-...is at our Southern border.

00:10:27.125 --> 00:10:28.294
-Because I know this statistic.

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.327
I didn't know
if you were going to use it,

00:10:29.327 --> 00:10:30.562
but I studied up on this.

00:10:30.562 --> 00:10:32.464
Do you know where
those 4,000 people come --

00:10:32.464 --> 00:10:33.832
where they're captured?

00:10:33.832 --> 00:10:35.567
Airports.
-Not always.

00:10:35.567 --> 00:10:37.269
-Airports.
-But certainly a large number --

00:10:37.269 --> 00:10:39.137
-The State Department says
there hasn't been any terrorist

00:10:39.137 --> 00:10:40.906
that they've found coming across
the Southern border from Mexico.

00:10:40.906 --> 00:10:42.875
-It's by air, it's by land,
and it's by sea.

00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:44.977
It's all of the above.
-No, it's not.

00:10:44.977 --> 00:10:47.179
It's only by air.

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:50.182
As soon as they fact-check her,
she turns into Paul Revere.

00:10:50.182 --> 00:10:53.786
It's one if by land, two
if by sea, and 4,000 by air!

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:54.753
[ Laughter ]

00:10:54.753 --> 00:10:56.087
Also, look at her face.

00:10:56.087 --> 00:10:58.724
She has literally never heard
a reporter use the words,

00:10:58.724 --> 00:11:00.359
"I studied up on this before."

00:11:00.359 --> 00:11:01.326
[ Laughter ]

00:11:01.326 --> 00:11:02.928
That's her "Oh, [bleep] face."

00:11:02.928 --> 00:11:05.397
She can't -- cannot believe...

00:11:05.397 --> 00:11:06.798
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:06.798 --> 00:11:09.935
She cannot believe
she is being fact-checked

00:11:09.935 --> 00:11:12.537
by someone on Fox News.

00:11:12.537 --> 00:11:14.039
As soon
as that interviewed ended,

00:11:14.039 --> 00:11:15.474
she stormed off the set
and screamed,

00:11:15.474 --> 00:11:18.177
"Who let them have Google?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:11:18.177 --> 00:11:20.713
Trump is totally incoherent and
incapable of telling the truth.

00:11:20.713 --> 00:11:23.749
He shouldn't get to address the
nation just to repeat his lies.

00:11:23.749 --> 00:11:26.318
If he calls up the networks
asking for air time,

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:27.919
they should pick up the phone
and say...

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:29.755
-President Trump?
We don't know who that is.

00:11:29.755 --> 00:11:32.358
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:32.358 --> 00:11:34.226
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:34.226 --> 00:11:36.262 line:0%
♪♪

